# Split Group Account Component

Individual account within a 0xSplits group that monitors ETH balances and split contract balances.

## Key Integration Pattern
Periodic balance monitoring (12s intervals) for both native ETH and split contract balances across multiple Ethereum nodes.

## Important Constraints
- Allocation values must be between 1 and 999999 (representing 0.0001% to 99.9999%)
- Balance metrics are tracked per account/node combination for redundancy